Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的说明会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,入部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道会有多少希望加入的人来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉反响还不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定值得期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,传单也发了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没输给别人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,金学长和
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,锅岛哥哥退出的空缺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,至少希望能进来两个人补上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.66,0:01:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,话虽这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,今年进来的肯定也全是男的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,早知道就写上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.46,0:02:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,“同时也招募可爱的女经理”就好了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 沟口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一脸阴沉的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我 要退出男子啦啦队部
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才没听清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,沟口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.53,0:02:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,说要退部哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不小心听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看了我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,演示表演的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.26,0:02:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,拥有绝妙后颈和小腿的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,新生女生说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.33,0:02:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是把我们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啦啦队部从根本上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,给否定了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们自己的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有让大家也
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,展露笑容明明是我们的宗旨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,却被说恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,被这么说的话确实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,会变得不想干啦啦队了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果不做啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.30,0:03:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,成为不一样的男子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,男子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,比如哪种
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,意气风发的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,和服男子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,优雅地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉会很受欢迎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉能在我们家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,当个帮手什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是去打工吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在大学里穿和服有点那个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那Kazu觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的男子比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,备战求职的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,西装男子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,五点下班后去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,攀岩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,精英集团的感觉嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉能进知名企业啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是就业以后就一直得穿西装了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还是做些只有学生时代才能做的男子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,比较好吧 比如
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.93,0:04:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,松鼠次郎男子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,而且很热
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那Ton觉得什么好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,其实小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有个憧憬的职业 是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,相扑男子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(966.667,989.333)}相扑口号
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dosukoi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ton确实会拿第二名呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,简直就是小学生力士嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,兜裆布怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那弦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得什么好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,说到受女孩子欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,会是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然是爽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,朗的体育男儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别放弃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我们已经退出网球社了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是哦
Comment: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,说到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,受女孩子欢迎的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么呢
Comment: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那就
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,女装男子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多男人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没一个人合适的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不如说更恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.53,0:05:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这没法正眼看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这一条路了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那恶心的笑容该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就以恶心萌的笑容为目标吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,总 总之
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,练习吧 练习
Comment: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,噢
Comment: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,正在看这段视频的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.60,0:05:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,运动苦手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,忙得根本
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没空去健身房
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,BREAKERS将向这样的你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,超简单
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好上手的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.66,0:06:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Up Dance (热身舞)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,介绍开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazu你也太起劲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,了吧 Haru
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,开朗一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是Up Dance啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓Up Dance
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,顾名思义
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.73,0:06:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Warm Up (热身)的舞蹈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们练习前也一直在跳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,比起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,柔韧练习和肌肉锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始就剧烈运动会受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,伤的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得对减肥也有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然说是跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但看着模仿就能学会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,用这套现在就能开始的快乐舞蹈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,让你也打破运动不足的日常吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.70,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微活动一下身体
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也能成为主角
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是漫不经心地坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也会变成自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.73,0:06:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧和我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.30,0:06:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,男子啦啦队一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,身心都
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's Cheer Up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(1048.667,989.333)}Side Step
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,基本的侧踏步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,左
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,向右踏步的同时拍手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还有各种各样的变种
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,之后和大家一起试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是进阶要点 (One Up Point)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,张开手的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,手肘 如果能配合肩膀的高度
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就能对肩胛骨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,周围的背阔肌产生效果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,向后拉手肘的话效果倍增
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,银也不用那么紧张嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟说到底也只是个侧踏步而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,放松放松
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是一学长
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,像我们这种半吊子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,来打头阵什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也没办法嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就用我珍藏的段子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,来逗笑大家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.46,0:08:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼头在紧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,张呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷 好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候才要跳Up Dance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快把身体热起来吧
Comment: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我所料
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,少骗人了 只是冷场了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,向右三个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抬起大腿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,抬起大腿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,合着节奏拍手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,膝盖要好好抬到腹部的高度
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这样做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对腹肌和腿部有效
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻跳跃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,双手也可以跟着上下摆动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这时要注意背部不要像虾一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,反弓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,预备 弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,常有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,擅自吃我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(966,990.667)}家畜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,点心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,常有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,擅自进我房间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,常有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,擅自穿我衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,常有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Haru家是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐吧 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是姐姐却擅自穿Haru的衣服吗 诶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,穿我的T恤当做睡衣 或者穿我的短裤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是经常有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但(被当做家畜)也经常有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,左右踏步的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,双手交握向前伸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,像交叉一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在另一只脚的后面踏步
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.53,0:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如果做得到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,试着把手也向后伸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要有意识地去拉伸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,肩膀周围和背部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为学习和工作一整天坐着的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,休息时只做这个动作也可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊好热
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,今天真热
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,本来那个蓬松头就已经够让人觉得热了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.16,0:10:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,至少请闭嘴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,预备
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.16,0:10:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,湿掉的西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是指煮过头变得软趴趴的西兰花吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(946.667,989.333)}湿润的西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Moist Broccoli
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了 请认真做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你才要认真做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是真的超绝认真在做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.30,0:11:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,微波炉加热过的西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不要弄湿后用微波炉加热
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别以为这么简单就算了 西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一边向上拉起手臂，一边想象用脚后跟去踢臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,将腿向后抬起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这对紧致臀部、提臀很有效
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,同样地将大腿向前抬起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.86,0:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个动作都要合着节奏、踩着步点来做做看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能做到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,进阶要点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(954.667,989.333)} One Up Point
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,试着用反侧的手去触碰向后抬起的脚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这个动作对腹部周围的腹斜肌有效
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,特别推荐给想要紧致侧腹、获得腰线的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,果然莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太羞耻了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Up Dance什么的 我们不是一直在做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,事到如今也没什么好害羞的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说Dance是这个和这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,男人之间穿同款还是有点那个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我和你搞在一起了一样 很恶心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,搞错了 虽然那也是原因之一但不是那个点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,话说 太遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要说哪里遗憾的话 T恤和裤子的搭配也很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那种想法本身也很遗憾 没救了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,休息时间 (Break Time)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,做一下基本的拉伸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,脚后跟紧紧贴地的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.53,0:13:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,腿部肌肉能得到很好伸展
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这时重心要控制在膝盖不超过脚尖的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,向右 向左
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,手脚伸直
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好好扭转腹部的同时面向正侧方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,扭转的时候为了不伤到腰部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,做到不要勉强的程度就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,体调管理也很重要哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,锅岛君
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,最近怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,工作是定下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是可能必须得搬家了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,关西分公司
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,方言什么的该怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是讲关西话比较好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也有句老话叫入乡随俗嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我也担心方言的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,金学长呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,其实还没正式定下来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有说到要去海外赴任的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,世界最幸福的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Petan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(990.667,989.333)}Bhutan
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.66,0:14:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是不丹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,锅岛君
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,金学长
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们互相加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,伸直膝盖 将腿交互向前踢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在双脚张开四十五度的状态下进行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就是髋关节的拉伸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对紧致大腿和小腿很有效
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是为了不弄伤膝盖 不要完全伸直 适度就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,跳跃并张开双腿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,同时举起双手摆出Pose
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一边跳跃一边收回
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.30,0:15:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,合着节奏反复做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,将手肘举到与肩同高
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对手臂的紧致和肩部肌肉有效
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果觉得痛的话不要勉强 放低一点也可以
Comment: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.30,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 我怎么了吗 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没 没什么 嗯
Comment: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.73,0:15:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会输呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,张开双腿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,右 左
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,交互弯曲膝盖 转动肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,脚尖向外张开四十五度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可以作为髋关节和腿部整体的拉伸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这时注意膝盖不要超过脚尖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,张开双腿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,腰部下沉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.50,0:16:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,扭转上身沉肩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,膝盖弯曲九十度 下沉腰部
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,能对髋关节和肩膀确实地起效
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果痛的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.53,0:16:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,膝盖弯曲的角度大概四十五度左右也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,总之严禁勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,预备
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs50}相扑术语: Nokotta
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:16:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哪边赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(892.667,989.333)}相扑力士名
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,山本山获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\pos(1016.667,985.333)}Kotsuchan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我是小铁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,举起双手轻轻跳跃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,同时单腿向上踢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始可能腿抬不太高
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,习惯之后就能一点点抬得更高了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不要太用力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,小心摔倒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,进阶要点 (One Up Point)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,试着用指尖去触碰脚尖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,对腿部的紧致很有效
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,示范是也
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,很简单吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哼哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沟口学长在呻吟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人好色哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:17:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为身体太硬了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.53,0:17:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟是我 嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 那个 也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是前辈也不用这么勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不进者必退，不退者必进
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,福泽谕吉的名言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好像已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.46,0:18:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像混进了 很多多余的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大概就是这种感觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的就看着我们 模仿着做做看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,做不到也不要在意不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那开始吧 Haru
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Up Dance Start
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好 开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,BREAKERS带来的Up Dance
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,合着节奏 三
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,二 呼呼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,吼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,呼呼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,吼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子他爹要生了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这都让做的什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One Two
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.90,0:19:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Three Four
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Five Six
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven Eight 一 二 三 四
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,One Two Three
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,男人就该默默地
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.60,0:19:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,四
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,五六
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 完全没对上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,反而有点碍事吧这个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Key on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheerleader
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We We
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Black and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.70,0:20:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yellow
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Five
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,B R E A K E R S
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Breakers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对对 那边的你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 来 再来一个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不要急慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,毅力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:20:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,毅力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,超毅力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:20:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray Hurray
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,挺能干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不错 不坏哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.90,0:21:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不要勉强哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.86,0:21:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一发
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy desu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不错哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然说坚持就是力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,听说爬上大学的铜像就会被退学
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,骗人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.73,0:21:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,说是参加奥运会就能拿到一百个学分
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,骗人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,听说学生结婚学费就能减半
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.53,0:21:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.73,0:21:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 为什么信了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,学生结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么Kin桑反应这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,呐 谁把笔记借我抄抄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.70,0:22:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是说这个的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(1062.667,989.333)}时间地点场合
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,请分清 T P O
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.26,0:22:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,本来都已经是大学生了还说借笔记给我抄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是高中生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazu Kazuma大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,金学长 锅岛哥哥 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.53,0:22:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我才一年级
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.86,0:22:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大三的课实在是不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.76,0:22:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.80,0:23:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好想去哪里玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,比如海边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,海边什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,海边不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.93,0:23:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果穿上紧绷绷的泳衣的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.16,0:23:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那什么 一夏的艳遇(Adventure)吧 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是被倾注而下的太阳热度 搞得头上的西兰花全是盐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.80,0:23:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,被泳装辣妹疯狂甩掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要是搭讪的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.53,0:23:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,滑雪场也不错哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那是建立在滑得很帅的前提下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,‘滑’这种事我很有自信
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.46,0:23:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,经常滑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,指用不好笑的笑话冷场
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 而且
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.33,0:23:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在雪山变白的话 头就是花椰菜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,讲了冷笑话太冷就是冷冻花椰菜了不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.50,0:23:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,大概都是因为你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.06,0:23:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,才冷场的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我的冷场有一半是你的责任 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.80,0:23:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,森林花椰菜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.86,0:23:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见 森林花椰菜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.36,0:23:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真是 你们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,感情真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:24:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大家的衣服都在哪里买的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,涉谷 原宿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.86,0:24:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么那么潮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,或者和女朋友在一起让她帮忙选之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,衣服我从来没自己买过
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.60,0:24:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是老妈买回来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.53,0:24:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,擅自买的 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说 才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.16,0:24:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是有好好自己买的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,都说不是了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.06,0:24:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抬起脚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.70,0:24:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,举起手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.53,0:24:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不抬脚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.73,0:24:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,放下手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.10,0:24:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 旗帜
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.66,0:24:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.66,0:24:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(942.667,989.333)}Flag Game
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.90,0:24:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs55\pos(1184.667,989.333)}抬起脚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.90,0:24:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是真正的抓小辫子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
